<title>SPAIN: Spain's Inespal new chairman appointed - SEPI.</title>
<headline>Spain's Inespal new chairman appointed - SEPI.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish state holding company SEPI said Leandro Guillen Barca will be the new chairman of aluminium producer Inespal on Friday.</p>
<p>Barca, at present director general at Inespal Laminacion and Inespal Conversion, will replace Javier Alvarez Vara.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
